  "airline": "SWA",
  "name": "Illinois One (Illinois flag)",
  "kind": "special",
  "from": "2022-09",
  "description": "Fuselage: White base; an enormous stylized bald eagle spans the whole fuselage: the white eagle head with yellow-orange beak and red banner at the nose, dark brown/maroon wings with black feather shapes sweeping aft along the window line to the tail; a stars-and-stripes shield (blue chief with white stars, red/white vertical stripes, gold border) with green olive leaves over the wing root; an orange/yellow rising sun near the tail. Cheatlines: None. Tail: Heart fin with white 'Southwest'. Engines: Brown/maroon with feather artwork (approximate). Winglets: White. Titles: 'Southwest' white on lower fin; 'Illinois One' small by cockpit. Artwork: Illinois state seal elements (eagle, shield, sunrise). Colors hex: approximate.",
